K</given-names></name><name><surname>Yli-Kerttula</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>Puolakka</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>J&#x000e4;rvinen</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Hakola</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Piirainen</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Ahonen</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>P&#x000e4;lvim&#x000e4;ki</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Forsberg</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Koota</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Friman</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Comparison of combination therapy with single-drug therapy in early rheumatoid arthritis: a randomised trial. FIN-RACo trial group</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>1999</year><volume>353</volume><fpage>1568</fpage><lpage>1573</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10334255</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0140-6736(98)08513-4</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B5"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Boers</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Verhoeven</surname><given-names>AC</given-names></name><name><surname>Markusse</surname><given-names>HM</given-names></name><name><surname>Laar</surname><given-names>MA van de</given-names></name><name><surname>Westhovens</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>van Denderen</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name><name><surname>van Zeben</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Dijkmans</surname><given-names>BA</given-names></name><name><surname>Peeters</surname><given-names>AJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Jacobs</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Brink</surname><given-names>HR van den</given-names></name><name><surname>Schouten</